00:40:53.119 --> 00:41:01.440 align:start position:19%
with a social justice agenda. So I'm
quoting uh Lent and colleagues. Uh but

00:40:58.720 --> 00:41:07.119 align:start position:19%
the upshot here uh however you interpret
that last part, I think it's important

00:41:03.119 --> 00:41:10.560 align:start position:19%
to recognize that our cultures give us
uh the language that we use to

00:41:09.119 --> 00:41:15.680 align:start position:19%
understand what is helpful and what is
harmful. And so it's important to be

00:41:12.800 --> 00:41:19.200 align:start position:19%
sensitive to how uh these therapies can
have cultural impacts as well. So the

00:41:17.599 --> 00:41:22.400 align:start position:19%
kinds of adverse events that we're
talking about include adverse change in

